  _GrammarSpec('gr-a1-x27', CefrLevel.a1, 'Numbers, dates and clock time', 'Cardinal numbers count: drei Tage. Ordinal numbers identify order and take adjective-like endings: der dritte Tag, am dritten Mai. Clock time uses um; dates commonly use am plus an ordinal in the dative.', 'Der Kurs beginnt am dritten Mai.', 'Der Kurs beginnt an drei Mai.',
