  _GrammarSpec('gr-a1-x28', CefrLevel.a1, 'Generic man', 'The pronoun man refers to people in general or to an unspecified person. It always takes a third-person singular verb. Its accusative form is einen and its dative form is einem.', 'Hier kann man gut essen.', 'Hier können man gut essen.',
