      _GrammarDrill('Which principle and caution belong together?', 'The rightmost element guides word class, but lexicalized meaning must still be learned.', 'The first syllable always supplies gender and complete meaning.', 'Every derived word is fully predictable from its letters.', 0, 'Morphological structure constrains grammar, while lexical convention determines actual usage and meaning.'),
